# Upstream CRDs vendored as test data for the required-field API-server harness
# (go-kure/launcher#883). Each is pinned to its upstream blob by the SOURCE file
# beside it and held to that pin by the package's tests, so it is not reviewed by
# hand. Marking it generated collapses its diff on GitHub and leaves it out of the
# hosted pr-review: adding or re-vendoring the largest CRDs produces hunks over
# that review's per-hunk ceiling, which would otherwise mark the PR's review
# incomplete. The review reads this file from the PR's base commit, never from
# the PR's head.
pkg/oam/builtin/components/testdata/upstream/prometheus-operator/example/prometheus-operator-crd/*.yaml linguist-generated
pkg/oam/builtin/components/testdata/upstream/*/config/crd/bases/*.yaml linguist-generated
